Automated the CI/CD pipeline in `.gitlab-ci.yml` using GitLab variables (`DOCKERHUB_USER`, `DOCKERHUB_PASS`, `KUBECONFIG`) to build container 
images from source (`./ci-cd-app3/`), configured HTTP-to-HTTPS redirects, aligned source HTML hyperlinks (`/app1/phpinfo.php`),
and deployed dynamic `$CI_COMMIT_SHA` updates directly to the existing 5 cluster applications (`app1` to `app5`, `postgres-db`) in namespace `webapp-ns`.

